### Feature Roles — CRUD
### Modalidad: JWT + RBAC (login como admin)
### Ejecutar en orden: el CREATE guarda el id que usan los siguientes.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 2

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### GET ALL — los 5 roles de TazaNorte
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CREATE -> 201 (el nombre se guarda en MAYÚSCULAS)
# @name crearRol
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mesero.tarde",
  "description": "Entrega pedidos dentro del local"
}

### 409 — nombre ya en uso (sin importar mayúsculas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "caja"
}

### PUT — reemplazo completo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{crearRol.response.body.$.role.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DOMICILIOS",
  "description": "Entrega de pedidos para llevar y a domicilio"
}

### PATCH — parcial (`status` se ignora)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{crearRol.response.body.$.role.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Domicilios zona norte",
  "status": "inactive"
}

### DELETE lógico
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{crearRol.response.body.$.role.id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DELETE físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{crearRol.response.body.$.role.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
